### Health
GET http://127.0.0.1:8050/health

### Analytics: campaigns performed best
POST http://127.0.0.1:8050/copilot/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Which campaigns performed best?",
  "role_code": "campaign_manager",
  "include_context": true,
  "execute_sql": true,
  "row_limit": 100,
  "include_debug": true
}

